<section id="admin-page" class="page-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="admin-page-title">
  <header class="admin-hero">
    <div><span class="eyebrow"><span class="green-dot"></span> EDGE / OPERATIONS DESK</span><h1 id="admin-page-title">IN <span>CONTROL.</span><span class="admin-hero-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></h1><p>Your events. Your markets. Every result, accounted for.</p></div>
    <div class="admin-hero-meta"><span class="admin-mode-badge" id="admin-mode-badge">ADMIN ACCESS</span><span>GAMES / ODDS / RESULTS</span><span>THE ENGINE BEHIND THE GAME ↗</span></div>
  </header>
  <div class="admin-access" id="admin-access"><span class="admin-access-icon"><svg><use href="#i-lock"/></svg></span><h2>Operations access</h2><p id="admin-access-message">Sign in with an administrator account to manage games, odds and settlements.</p><button class="button green" data-admin-signin>Sign in <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></div>
  <div id="admin-workspace" hidden>
    <div class="admin-notice" id="admin-preview-notice" hidden><span class="demo-badge">READ-ONLY PREVIEW</span><p>Explore a fictional operations desk. Connect to the Laravel app and sign in as an administrator to publish games, review payments and settle stakes.</p></div>
    <div class="admin-feedback" id="admin-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <div class="admin-summary" id="admin-summary" aria-label="Operations summary"></div>
    <div class="admin-toolbar"><div class="admin-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Administration sections"><button class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="admin-events-tab" id="admin-tab-events" data-admin-tab="events">Games & results <span id="admin-games-count">0</span></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="admin-payments-tab" id="admin-tab-payments" data-admin-tab="payments">Payment requests <span id="admin-requests-count">0</span></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="admin-copy-tab" id="admin-tab-copy" data-admin-tab="copy">Copy picks <span id="admin-picks-count">0</span></button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="admin-settings-tab" id="admin-tab-settings" data-admin-tab="settings">Payment settings</button></div><button class="admin-refresh" id="admin-refresh" aria-label="Refresh admin data"><svg><use href="#i-clock"/></svg><span>Refresh desk</span></button></div>
    <div class="admin-tab-panel" id="admin-events-tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="admin-tab-events">
      <div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">BUILD THE MARKET / 01</span><h2>The game board<span>.</span></h2><p>Set the schedule, manage odds and publish final scores.</p></div><button class="button green" data-admin-new-event>New game <svg><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></button></div>
      <div class="admin-board-layout"><div class="admin-board-main"><div class="admin-filters"><label class="admin-search"><svg><use href="#i-search"/></svg><input type="search" id="admin-event-search" placeholder="Search teams or leagues" aria-label="Search admin games"></label><select id="admin-event-status" aria-label="Filter games by status"><option value="all">Every status</option><option value="draft">Draft</option><option value="open">Open</option><option value="live">Live</option><option value="suspended">Suspended</option><option value="finished">Finished</option><option value="void">Voided</option></select></div><div id="admin-event-list" class="admin-event-list"></div></div><aside class="admin-rail"><div class="admin-process-card"><span class="section-kicker">FROM KICKOFF TO PAYOUT</span><h3>ONE RESULT.<br>EVERY STAKE<span>.</span></h3><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Open the market</strong><p>Create a game and publish its odds.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Close the action</strong><p>Suspend markets when staking ends.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Make it final</strong><p>Confirm the final score. Eligible returns settle into wallets.</p></div></li></ol><div class="admin-rail-note"><svg><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><p>Stakes keep the odds accepted at placement. Later odds updates apply to new stakes.</p></div></div><div class="admin-audit-card"><div><span class="section-kicker">A RECORD OF EVERY MOVE</span><span class="status-dot"></span></div><h3>Recent activity</h3><div id="admin-audit-list"></div></div></aside></div>
    </div>
    <div class="admin-tab-panel" id="admin-payments-tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="admin-tab-payments" hidden><div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">MONEY IN. MONEY OUT. / 02</span><h2>Payment desk<span>.</span></h2><p>Review each request against the actual payment before approving.</p></div><label class="admin-inline-filter">Show<select id="admin-request-status"><option value="pending">Pending requests</option><option value="all">All requests</option><option value="approved">Approved</option><option value="rejected">Rejected</option></select></label></div><div class="admin-payment-note"><svg><use href="#i-wallet"/></svg><p>Review manual deposits and withdrawals against your payment records. Stripe deposits are credited from verified payment notifications. Withdrawal approval records a completed bank transfer; it does not send one.</p></div><div id="admin-request-list" class="admin-request-list"></div></div>
    <div class="admin-tab-panel" id="admin-copy-tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="admin-tab-copy" hidden><div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">A SHARED EDGE / 03</span><h2>Lead the next play<span>.</span></h2><p>Publish a pick to copy it into eligible funded positions.</p></div><button class="button green" data-admin-new-pick>Publish a pick <svg><use href="#i-plus"/></svg></button></div><div class="admin-copy-explainer"><span class="admin-copy-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h3>One pick. A shared position.</h3><p>The strategy’s allocation rate determines each copied stake. Paused positions and positions without enough available funds are skipped. Copy stakes settle from the same final game score.</p></div><span class="admin-copy-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div id="admin-pick-list" class="admin-pick-list"></div></div>
    <div class="admin-tab-panel" id="admin-settings-tab" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="admin-tab-settings" hidden><div class="admin-content-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">YOUR PAYMENT CHANNELS / 04</span><h2>Set the flow<span>.</span></h2><p>Manage Stripe credentials and configure manual payment methods below.</p></div><button class="button green" data-admin-edit-settings disabled>Edit settings <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></div><div id="admin-payment-settings" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="admin-settings-policy"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><p>Stripe prohibits gambling, including sports betting. Keep card payments disabled for staking funds. <a href="https://stripe.com/legal/restricted-businesses" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Stripe’s restricted businesses ↗</a></p></div></div>
    <div class="admin-desk-footer"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> EVERY ACTION HAS A RECORD</span><span id="admin-updated-at">OPERATIONS DESK / EDGE</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="admin-modal-backdrop" id="admin-modal" hidden><section class="admin-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="admin-modal-title"><button class="icon-button admin-modal-close" data-admin-close aria-label="Close admin dialog"><svg><use href="#i-close"/></svg></button><div id="admin-modal-content"></div></section></div>
</section>
